{"at":"2026-11-17T15:45:23.551Z","kind":"verdict","pass":false,"reason":"inventory_movement_list changed by 0 (expected 1); inventory_transaction_list changed by 0 (expected 1); Calgary on hand is 10, not 6","stop":"answered","answer":"I reserved the 4 Field notebooks, but **I couldn't ship them.** The final step, posting the shipment, failed, so the check of the plan did not pass.\n\n**What worked:**\n- **Reservation RES-SO-000001-1** is active. It holds 4 EA of Field notebook (OFF-100) at Calgary warehouse (CAL-WH) for SO-000001 line 1. Calgary now has 10 on hand, 4 reserved and 6 available.\n- **Shipment SHP-000001** was created as a draft. It's from CAL-WH to Lethbridge Millwork receiving, 400 Mayor Magrath Dr, Lethbridge AB, and has one line for 4 EA linked to the reservation.\n\n**What failed:** The system rejected the shipment with \"INVENTORY_STOCK_NEGATIVE: … projects stock below zero.\" This is a timing problem, not a stock shortage. I dated the shipment today, 2026-11-17, which the system records as midnight UTC. Calgary's only stock, the opening adjustment STK-000001, was recorded later that day at 15:44:33 UTC. At midnight there was nothing on hand, so the shipment would have taken stock below zero.\n\nSHP-000001 is still a draft, so nothing has shipped and SO-000001 still shows 4 open to ship. To fix it, I can change the shipment's effective date and time to after 15:44:33 UTC today, then post it again. Do you want me to do that?"}
